# Python pipeline pointers

Host safety only. Data-model and publication truth live elsewhere.

| Need | Go to |
| --- | --- |
| Galaxy model / embeddings / UMAP | `docs/data/galaxy-model.md` |
| Refresh / publication / R2 | `docs/data/refresh-and-publication.md` |
| Contracts | `docs/system/planet-export-contract.md`, `docs/system/og-index-worker-contract.md` |
| Navigation | `docs/system/decision-index.md` |
| Source | `scripts/` (active: `feature_engineering/`, `export/`, `pipeline/`, `cron/`) |
| Raw CSV | never open in chat — see `data-protection.mdc` |
| Tests | `scripts/tests/` via `python -m pytest` |

Do not treat this rule as a second Data Pipeline SSOT.
